    {
      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the logging service**\n\nI've decided to proceed with Google Cloud Logging as the target managed service. Now I have to determine how best to incorporate its specific identifier into the Python code. I am focusing on making the code simple, reliable, and easily deployable. I will explore various Python libraries and methods that seamlessly integrate with Google Cloud Logging.\n\n\n**Implementing the logging code**\n\nI'm now fully committed to a `write_structured_log.py` file, incorporating Google Cloud Logging. My focus is writing Python code utilizing its client library, ensuring the inclusion of provider-specific identifiers. The code will center on sending a structured JSON log.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789819592487,
          "start": 1789819590660
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0b98f98040013inpfcQrEvgVgL",
      "message_id": "msg_0b98f92a1001MdEGkexNa2EGDU",
      "session_id": "ses_f46706dd8ffe6JQxLQIb60zV30",
